From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Lu=C3=ADs=20Duarte?= <lduarte@cloudflare.com>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 14:31:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Scope linked stylesheets to their <link media> attribute

External sheets were parsed with MediaList::empty(), so a media="print"
sheet cascaded on screen: sigarra.up.pt's print CSS (#cabecalho /
#colunaprincipal / #colunaextra display:none) erased the whole page
chrome from screen renders. Parse the owning link's media attribute
into the sheet's MediaList (via a helper shared with the <style media>
path) so stylo re-evaluates it against the device on every cascade.
